.git
.gitignore
**/.env
virbius-demo/config.json
virbius-demo/licenses/
target/
**/target/
data/
*.md
scripts/
.github/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.log
*.db
*.jsonl
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
# Host-built Node artifacts must never enter the build context: a macOS
# frontend/node makes the frontend-maven-plugin skip its Linux Node download
# and npm then exits 127 inside the container; host node_modules are the wrong
# platform and are reinstalled by `npm ci` anyway.
**/node_modules/
virbius-control/frontend/node/
# Heavy directories no image build COPYs — keep the build context small (the
# daemon ingests every non-ignored byte; virbius-guard training data alone is
# ~100 GB and will fill the Docker Desktop disk).
virbius-guard/
virbius-intent/
virbius-eval/
virbius-integrate/
docs/
examples/
deploy/
